| 18 | 40019 | Jumlah Restart Logger | count |
| 19 | 40020 | Timestamp **YYMM** (mis. `2604` = Apr 2026) | — |
| 20 | 40021 | Timestamp **DDHH** (mis. `2911` = tgl 29 jam 11) | — |
| 21 | 40022 | Timestamp **mmss** (mis. `3005` = mnt 30 dtk 05) | — |

